(4192052, 604113, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the little stars that come from the various lights. I might adjust contrast to give the sky more black and the colors a touch more punch.</td>', 'I love the little stars that come from the various lights. I might adjust contrast to give the sky more black and the colors a touch more punch.', '2007-10-24 09:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
