(4192596, 604084, 74059, '<td valign="top">This seems like just a snapshot. I''m afraid it''s uninteresting.</td>', 'This seems like just a snapshot. I''m afraid it''s uninteresting.', '2007-10-24 13:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192597, 603026, 85155, '<td valign="top">I really like the shadow in this picture.  I realize it is hard to get a shot like this, because you can''t just tell the butterfly what to do, but I don''t like that it is flying out of the image.  It would look better if the butterfly had some room to move through the frame, but in order to get the shadow right and give the butterfly some room, you need to be at a different angle.</td>', 'I really like the shadow in this picture.  I realize it is hard to get a shot like this, because you can''t just tell the butterfly what to do, but I don''t like that it is flying out of the image.  It would look better if the butterfly had some room to move through the frame, but in order to get the shadow right and give the butterfly some room, you need to be at a different angle.', '2007-10-24 13:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192598, 602743, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice s-curve, I wish it was leading to something though, or maybe I could see who is using this open road, maybe a car, a person.  Nice idea though, I think this shot is very well composed.</td>', 'Nice s-curve, I wish it was leading to something though, or maybe I could see who is using this open road, maybe a car, a person.  Nice idea though, I think this shot is very well composed.', '2007-10-24 13:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192601, 604006, 85155, '<td valign="top">I wish the buds were in focus here, this is an interesting concept, and you did a nice job with a macro shot.</td>', 'I wish the buds were in focus here, this is an interesting concept, and you did a nice job with a macro shot.', '2007-10-24 13:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192605, 603498, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like the b&amp;w conversion, and the fact that the monkey has somehwere to look, rather than positioning him at the right of the frame.  I also think the dof helps to make the wall in the distance look like it is further away than I am sure it really is.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the b&w conversion, and the fact that the monkey has somehwere to look, rather than positioning him at the right of the frame.  I also think the dof helps to make the wall in the distance look like it is further away than I am sure it really is.  Nicely done.', '2007-10-24 13:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192606, 602507, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like the sky, and the background in this shot, I think the wooden thing in the foreground is distracting though.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the sky, and the background in this shot, I think the wooden thing in the foreground is distracting though.  Nice shot.', '2007-10-24 13:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192611, 602819, 74059, '<td valign="top">I really like the texture and color of the steel columns.  But you have the same problem I have in my photos: a great subject with a bunch of unrelated and distracting stuff all around it. Maybe a different angle or cropping would fix it.</td>', 'I really like the texture and color of the steel columns.  But you have the same problem I have in my photos: a great subject with a bunch of unrelated and distracting stuff all around it. Maybe a different angle or cropping would fix it.', '2007-10-24 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192613, 604020, 28322, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and cropping,</td>', 'Nice capture and cropping,', '2007-10-24 13:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192614, 602402, 28322, '<td valign="top">Creative idea and wonderful composition, <br/>I like the twinking lights in the background and the crystal clear sharpness, <br/>Very well done, <br/>Cheers,</td>', 'Creative idea and wonderful composition, I like the twinking lights in the background and the crystal clear sharpness, Very well done, Cheers,', '2007-10-24 13:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192615, 603640, 74059, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic! My favorite so far.</td>', 'This is fantastic! My favorite so far.', '2007-10-24 13:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192616, 604080, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture of serenity.  It meets the challenge very well and the soft range of blues and purples (especially in the reflection) are simply magnificent.  8</td>', 'Wonderful picture of serenity.  It meets the challenge very well and the soft range of blues and purples (especially in the reflection) are simply magnificent.  8', '2007-10-24 13:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192618, 603958, 28322, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot and great composition, very well done, <br/>Cheers,</td>', 'Wonderful shot and great composition, very well done, Cheers,', '2007-10-24 13:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192619, 602396, 85155, '<td valign="top">For a sunrise shot I would have expected a more interesting sky.  I can tell it is sunrise from the lighting on their faces, but that is the only reason.  I really would like to see what they are looking at, since this is a distance challenge, try to show the distance, rather than just hinting that it is there.</td>', 'For a sunrise shot I would have expected a more interesting sky.  I can tell it is sunrise from the lighting on their faces, but that is the only reason.  I really would like to see what they are looking at, since this is a distance challenge, try to show the distance, rather than just hinting that it is there.', '2007-10-24 13:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192621, 603828, 68035, '<td valign="top">I am not sure why but I really like this shot.  So many lovely little touches, the great black and white conversion, a border that enhances the image and the shot itself.  Minimal but not sparse.  Very good composition</td>', 'I am not sure why but I really like this shot.  So many lovely little touches, the great black and white conversion, a border that enhances the image and the shot itself.  Minimal but not sparse.  Very good composition', '2007-10-24 13:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192622, 603382, 85155, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that the horizon is right in the middle of this shot, I think if you raised it it would give even more of a feeling that the colors are as far as I can see.  I like how the tree in the left helps to frame the shot, and the colors are nice.</td>', 'I don''t like that the horizon is right in the middle of this shot, I think if you raised it it would give even more of a feeling that the colors are as far as I can see.  I like how the tree in the left helps to frame the shot, and the colors are nice.', '2007-10-24 13:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192624, 603371, 28322, '<td valign="top">A great idea for sure, wonderful lighting and sharpness, <br/>The only thing I have against, is the clean Jeans, doesn''t reflect the rough life of a homeless, <br/>This doesn''t mean by any chance it is not wonderful, <br/>Very well done<br/>Cheers,</td>', 'A great idea for sure, wonderful lighting and sharpness, The only thing I have against, is the clean Jeans, doesn''t reflect the rough life of a homeless, This doesn''t mean by any chance it is not wonderful, Very well doneCheers,', '2007-10-24 13:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192625, 603623, 74059, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. I really like the punch of color in the center. Very well composed.</td>', 'This is lovely. I really like the punch of color in the center. Very well composed.', '2007-10-24 13:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192626, 602121, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and a lovely B&amp;W conversion which is soft but yet not lacking in anyway.  Nice image7</td>', 'Great perspective and a lovely B&W conversion which is soft but yet not lacking in anyway.  Nice image7', '2007-10-24 13:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192627, 602745, 85155, '<td valign="top">I really like the b&amp;w conversion here, and the foreground object helps me to visualize that I am watching this guy, but I don''t want to be seen.  I think the composition is great, just try to watch out for blow outs, there are several areas in the picture, like the back wall, that have no detail.  Great shot overall.</td>', 'I really like the b&w conversion here, and the foreground object helps me to visualize that I am watching this guy, but I don''t want to be seen.  I think the composition is great, just try to watch out for blow outs, there are several areas in the picture, like the back wall, that have no detail.  Great shot overall.', '2007-10-24 13:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192630, 604099, 74059, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea and texture of the wall adds to the look.  But it''s waaaay too dark.</td>', 'This is a cool idea and texture of the wall adds to the look.  But it''s waaaay too dark.', '2007-10-24 13:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192631, 603996, 68035, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhhh a real steal your breath away shot.  Lots and lots of wonderful elements.  Very strong leading lines and a wonderful richness of midnight blue sky which sets off the moon and clouds brilliantly<br/> <br/>Simple, effective, stunning - 9</td>', 'Ohhhhhh a real steal your breath away shot.  Lots and lots of wonderful elements.  Very strong leading lines and a wonderful richness of midnight blue sky which sets off the moon and clouds brilliantly Simple, effective, stunning - 9', '2007-10-24 13:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192632, 602072, 85155, '<td valign="top">I really like the lines formed by the stairs, this would make a good, from the ground up shot, I think, but it works for this one too.  I only wish that I could make out more details of the guy at the top of the stairs, but I guess that is hard to see with a low res photo.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I really like the lines formed by the stairs, this would make a good, from the ground up shot, I think, but it works for this one too.  I only wish that I could make out more details of the guy at the top of the stairs, but I guess that is hard to see with a low res photo.  Nicely done.', '2007-10-24 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192635, 602739, 74059, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the subtle color but the "sun" looks like a nuclear blast.</td>', 'I like the composition and the subtle color but the "sun" looks like a nuclear blast.', '2007-10-24 13:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192637, 603953, 85155, '<td valign="top">I think you did great with the composition here, but I don''t think it is as clever, or well thought out, as a lot of the other pictures I have been seeing.</td>', 'I think you did great with the composition here, but I don''t think it is as clever, or well thought out, as a lot of the other pictures I have been seeing.', '2007-10-24 13:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192640, 604075, 85155, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea here, and I realize how difficult it is to get detail out of the moon and still expose correctly for the rest of the shot, but the moon almost just looks like a spot that got onto your picture rather than something that was meant to be there, I really like the mood cast by the clouds though.</td>', 'I really like the idea here, and I realize how difficult it is to get detail out of the moon and still expose correctly for the rest of the shot, but the moon almost just looks like a spot that got onto your picture rather than something that was meant to be there, I really like the mood cast by the clouds though.', '2007-10-24 13:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192642, 603806, 28322, '<td valign="top">Simply wonderful, Creative idea and wonderful composition, <br/>Btw, in the 1800s they didn''t use candles made in China ;) <br/>Just kidding, <br/>Very well done, <br/>Cheers,</td>', 'Simply wonderful, Creative idea and wonderful composition, Btw, in the 1800s they didn''t use candles made in China ;) Just kidding, Very well done, Cheers,', '2007-10-24 13:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192644, 604014, 74059, '<td valign="top">The composition is great but the photo is a bit washed out and the color of the border seems to make it worse.</td>', 'The composition is great but the photo is a bit washed out and the color of the border seems to make it worse.', '2007-10-24 13:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192645, 603863, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like the dof in this shot and the direction of her eyes with the lines of the track help lead me into looking off into the distance, nice b&amp;w conversion.</td>', 'I like the dof in this shot and the direction of her eyes with the lines of the track help lead me into looking off into the distance, nice b&w conversion.', '2007-10-24 13:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192649, 603674, 74059, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Great composition.</td>', 'Excellent! Great composition.', '2007-10-24 13:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192650, 604009, 85155, '<td valign="top">The tracks seem to be leading me up the hill to that thing that is on top, but that part of the picture is very dark and not very sharp.  The lines from the footprints are very well done to help direct my eyes, but when I get to the tower, I am lost.</td>', 'The tracks seem to be leading me up the hill to that thing that is on top, but that part of the picture is very dark and not very sharp.  The lines from the footprints are very well done to help direct my eyes, but when I get to the tower, I am lost.', '2007-10-24 13:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192652, 603104, 85155, '<td valign="top">This shot looks very 2d to me, yes I realize it is a picture, but the lighting and the sky make everything look very flat.  There isn''t really any detail to the picture, it almost looks like a drawing.</td>', 'This shot looks very 2d to me, yes I realize it is a picture, but the lighting and the sky make everything look very flat.  There isn''t really any detail to the picture, it almost looks like a drawing.', '2007-10-24 13:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192656, 603696, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like the dof, and the stick and ruler help lead me to the action, that is nice.  I''m not sure that distance and length are synonymous though, I don''t think this is a clear fit for the challenge.</td>', 'I like the dof, and the stick and ruler help lead me to the action, that is nice.  I''m not sure that distance and length are synonymous though, I don''t think this is a clear fit for the challenge.', '2007-10-24 13:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192658, 601689, 74059, '<td valign="top">I really like this but I''m a little confused by what she''s wearing on her feet.  Are those boots?</td>', 'I really like this but I''m a little confused by what she''s wearing on her feet.  Are those boots?', '2007-10-24 13:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192661, 603357, 74059, '<td valign="top">Gasp! This is so peaceful and serene. Well done</td>', 'Gasp! This is so peaceful and serene. Well done', '2007-10-24 13:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192663, 603670, 85155, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would have been more effective if the sky and water didn''t blend right in.  I realize that you probably did this on purpose from your title, but it doesn''t work for me.  I also wish that the people were more in focus.</td>', 'I think this shot would have been more effective if the sky and water didn''t blend right in.  I realize that you probably did this on purpose from your title, but it doesn''t work for me.  I also wish that the people were more in focus.', '2007-10-24 13:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192667, 603514, 85155, '<td valign="top">If you need to use the title to make your shot fit the challenge, it probably doesn''t.  Just looking at the picture I see nothing that gives me the sense of distance, although the title can be used to help, it shouldn''t be the only factor in helping me see the theme.</td>', 'If you need to use the title to make your shot fit the challenge, it probably doesn''t.  Just looking at the picture I see nothing that gives me the sense of distance, although the title can be used to help, it shouldn''t be the only factor in helping me see the theme.', '2007-10-24 13:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192668, 603942, 74059, '<td valign="top">What a great landscape. I''m distracted by the buildings though.</td>', 'What a great landscape. I''m distracted by the buildings though.', '2007-10-24 13:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192670, 601936, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice job framing this barn, but it isn''t really in the distance, everything else is, and it is clearly the main focus.</td>', 'Nice job framing this barn, but it isn''t really in the distance, everything else is, and it is clearly the main focus.', '2007-10-24 13:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192674, 602219, 61818, '<td valign="top">How original.</td>', 'How original.', '2007-10-24 13:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192678, 603989, 12998, '<td valign="top">Could have been very dramatic as a B&amp;W image</td>', 'Could have been very dramatic as a B&W image', '2007-10-24 13:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192680, 604120, 85155, '<td valign="top">This shot is nicely done, the diagonal line formed by the fence really helps out, and the fact that I can''t really see it end is good too.  It kind of feels like the picture is crooked, but I realize that is probably because there is a hill on the left, but it is still hard to see this as a straight shot.</td>', 'This shot is nicely done, the diagonal line formed by the fence really helps out, and the fact that I can''t really see it end is good too.  It kind of feels like the picture is crooked, but I realize that is probably because there is a hill on the left, but it is still hard to see this as a straight shot.', '2007-10-24 13:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4192688, 603944, 85155, '<td valign="top">Why is the boat in the shot?  It looks like an accident, if it isn''t then don''t cut part of it off.  The horizon looks a little crooked to me too.</td>', 'Why is the boat in the shot?  It looks like an accident, if it isn''t then don''t cut part of it off.  The horizon looks a little crooked to me too.', '2007-10-24 13:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
