(4194470, 603987, 84101, '<td valign="top">nice. I would have framed the first tower on the right a little tighter to the right side...but wtf do I know? I love the vastness of the shot!</td>', 'nice. I would have framed the first tower on the right a little tighter to the right side...but wtf do I know? I love the vastness of the shot!', '2007-10-25 04:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
