(4194528, 602219, 30791, '<td valign="top">im not too familiar with the icelandic law but would it be considered a fellony if you removed those orange stakes on the sides of the road? thats the only thing i can see from this photo being flawless</td>', 'im not too familiar with the icelandic law but would it be considered a fellony if you removed those orange stakes on the sides of the road? thats the only thing i can see from this photo being flawless', '2007-10-25 06:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
