(4194553, 604014, 23251, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why you would use such a thick border and make your photo smaller. Good idea but can''t really tell where the battle is apart from a flag.</td>', 'I''m not sure why you would use such a thick border and make your photo smaller. Good idea but can''t really tell where the battle is apart from a flag.', '2007-10-25 07:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
