(4194632, 603788, 60915, '<td valign="top">I like the centered comp and the moody sky!<br/>I''d actually like to see this a little bit darker, I think it would add a little more drama! : ) Nice one!</td>', 'I like the centered comp and the moody sky!I''d actually like to see this a little bit darker, I think it would add a little more drama! : ) Nice one!', '2007-10-25 09:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
