(4195154, 603674, 85464, '<td valign="top">Nice light on the cliff face.</td>', 'Nice light on the cliff face.', '2007-10-25 13:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195178, 604067, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Love the color and composition. 9</td>', 'Great shot. Love the color and composition. 9', '2007-10-25 14:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195247, 603902, 32117, '<td valign="top">What is this buddy????</td>', 'What is this buddy????', '2007-10-25 14:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195257, 602361, 32117, '<td valign="top">Good one<br/>8</td>', 'Good one8', '2007-10-25 15:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195283, 602745, 85886, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot, but I can''t decide whether it should be cropped a little.  It definitely gives it a much more voyeuristic feel hiding behind the signange but does distract from the very strong image of the man on the telephone and his obvious body language.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot, but I can''t decide whether it should be cropped a little.  It definitely gives it a much more voyeuristic feel hiding behind the signange but does distract from the very strong image of the man on the telephone and his obvious body language.  Nice shot.', '2007-10-25 15:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195351, 602219, 85886, '<td valign="top">Superb!  If this conforms to the basic editing rules then it''s a 10/10 from me - there''s nothing I can criticise at all and is just perfect.  Well done!</td>', 'Superb!  If this conforms to the basic editing rules then it''s a 10/10 from me - there''s nothing I can criticise at all and is just perfect.  Well done!', '2007-10-25 15:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195355, 603795, 85886, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love that you''ve managed to get the lighting just right, extending right down to his fingernails - and to freeze him at night without blur... most impressive :)</td>', 'Great shot.  I love that you''ve managed to get the lighting just right, extending right down to his fingernails - and to freeze him at night without blur... most impressive :)', '2007-10-25 15:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195359, 603447, 85886, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  Love the obviously good framing, sun position and DoF but most of all I love the palette of colours from the foreground greys across lush greens and reds/oranges to the blue.  This is one of those photos where a lifeless sky actually strengthens the photo rather than weakening it (clouds etc).</td>', 'Excellent shot.  Love the obviously good framing, sun position and DoF but most of all I love the palette of colours from the foreground greys across lush greens and reds/oranges to the blue.  This is one of those photos where a lifeless sky actually strengthens the photo rather than weakening it (clouds etc).', '2007-10-25 15:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195362, 602402, 85886, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Amazing shot.  Absolutely classic.  Pin sharp meter and glorious blurry lights.  10/10 and then some!</td>', 'Wow!  Amazing shot.  Absolutely classic.  Pin sharp meter and glorious blurry lights.  10/10 and then some!', '2007-10-25 15:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195364, 603863, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. The pose of your model iss pot on, as is the composition as a whole. My only slight, tiny, weeny disappointment is that rather than disapppearing to a vanishing point, the railway line ends rather abruptly with a horizontal line.  Excellent work.</td>', 'I like this very much. The pose of your model iss pot on, as is the composition as a whole. My only slight, tiny, weeny disappointment is that rather than disapppearing to a vanishing point, the railway line ends rather abruptly with a horizontal line.  Excellent work.', '2007-10-25 15:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195366, 601373, 67258, '<td valign="top">The perspective is good, and this is certainly an interesting take on the building.  I do wish that either more of the domed building behind was visible, or none at all.</td>', 'The perspective is good, and this is certainly an interesting take on the building.  I do wish that either more of the domed building behind was visible, or none at all.', '2007-10-25 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195370, 603129, 67258, '<td valign="top">This certainly fits the challenge well, and you have presented an intersting seascape well.  I am somewhat unsure about the presence of the power boat, although I would conceded that the placement of the line made by the wake pleasingly echoes the further line of the land on the horizon.</td>', 'This certainly fits the challenge well, and you have presented an intersting seascape well.  I am somewhat unsure about the presence of the power boat, although I would conceded that the placement of the line made by the wake pleasingly echoes the further line of the land on the horizon.', '2007-10-25 15:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195373, 603864, 67258, '<td valign="top">The leading line of the rail and the lights further on do give a good feeling of distance, but the photo lacks sufficient interest to hold my attention for long.  I feel it would benefit from some more foreground interest in the lower right.</td>', 'The leading line of the rail and the lights further on do give a good feeling of distance, but the photo lacks sufficient interest to hold my attention for long.  I feel it would benefit from some more foreground interest in the lower right.', '2007-10-25 15:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195374, 603870, 85886, '<td valign="top">Beautiful layering, great colours and above all beautiful in its simplicity.  Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful layering, great colours and above all beautiful in its simplicity.  Well done!', '2007-10-25 15:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195377, 602335, 67258, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, certainly, but could benefit from a different composition.  as it is, it is just a straight record shot of the moon, with little artistic interpretation.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, certainly, but could benefit from a different composition.  as it is, it is just a straight record shot of the moon, with little artistic interpretation.', '2007-10-25 15:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195379, 603315, 67258, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, and well articulated.</td>', 'Interesting concept, and well articulated.', '2007-10-25 15:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195380, 603902, 85886, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what you mean by troll trap, but if you mean to refer to someone who dislikes your photography as a troll then I suspect you need to grow a thicker skin.  This isn''t a good photograph by my standards.  The exposure is all over the place with massive burnout and noticeable digital graining.  Compositionally it doesn''t say much to me, sorry.</td>', 'I have no idea what you mean by troll trap, but if you mean to refer to someone who dislikes your photography as a troll then I suspect you need to grow a thicker skin.  This isn''t a good photograph by my standards.  The exposure is all over the place with massive burnout and noticeable digital graining.  Compositionally it doesn''t say much to me, sorry.', '2007-10-25 15:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195381, 604099, 67258, '<td valign="top">A clever idea, but I find the grey tones a little flat.</td>', 'A clever idea, but I find the grey tones a little flat.', '2007-10-25 15:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195386, 603996, 85886, '<td valign="top">Now that''s what I call a moon photo!!  Really love this one in particular because of the textures and light.  The clouds are just glorious and the moon the cherry on top of it all.  Looks like it could be IR film to my eyes.  Fantastic shot.  I''d put this one on my wall anyday :)</td>', 'Now that''s what I call a moon photo!!  Really love this one in particular because of the textures and light.  The clouds are just glorious and the moon the cherry on top of it all.  Looks like it could be IR film to my eyes.  Fantastic shot.  I''d put this one on my wall anyday :)', '2007-10-25 16:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195432, 603601, 74605, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors.  The railroad tracks going under the bridge are great.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Pretty colors.  The railroad tracks going under the bridge are great.  Nicely done.', '2007-10-25 16:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
