(4196857, 602361, 82503, '<td valign="top">Yes, yes, yes, this is what I''ve been waiting for! Especially in North America you have those roads that go straight for miles and miles and do not seem to end. That would have been my choice for the challenge. <br/> <br/>I like the addition of a person in this one and the clouds are beautiful. Is she on the wrong side of the street or is this a left-driving country? Hope this wins a ribbon! 10.</td>', 'Yes, yes, yes, this is what I''ve been waiting for! Especially in North America you have those roads that go straight for miles and miles and do not seem to end. That would have been my choice for the challenge.  I like the addition of a person in this one and the clouds are beautiful. Is she on the wrong side of the street or is this a left-driving country? Hope this wins a ribbon! 10.', '2007-10-26 08:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
