(4197876, 603942, 23251, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo and great composition.</td>', 'Lovely photo and great composition.', '2007-10-26 17:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197886, 603601, 83313, '<td valign="top">Any more to the ground woudl be underneath it! Nice view, well composed.</td>', 'Any more to the ground woudl be underneath it! Nice view, well composed.', '2007-10-26 17:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197888, 603993, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m finding this a little plain. It does have good colros and detail though.</td>', 'I''m finding this a little plain. It does have good colros and detail though.', '2007-10-26 17:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197890, 604014, 64670, '<td valign="top">Unusual subject - it''s a shame about the exposure - it''s lost detail.<br/> <br/>The frame it a bit much too.</td>', 'Unusual subject - it''s a shame about the exposure - it''s lost detail. The frame it a bit much too.', '2007-10-26 17:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197891, 602742, 83313, '<td valign="top">My eye is trying to bear on the one that is out of focus.</td>', 'My eye is trying to bear on the one that is out of focus.', '2007-10-26 17:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197893, 602998, 83313, '<td valign="top">My gaze is drawn away from the horse and toward the trees in the distance.</td>', 'My gaze is drawn away from the horse and toward the trees in the distance.', '2007-10-26 17:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197895, 603944, 64670, '<td valign="top">Looks like a beautiful location, not sure you''ve captured the best of it.  Almost tried too hard to give us ''too much.  My eyes are trying to work out what you want me to notice -is it the boat?  Is it the refection in the water or is it the curve of the shore.  One of those in clearer focus would have been easier on the eye.</td>', 'Looks like a beautiful location, not sure you''ve captured the best of it.  Almost tried too hard to give us ''too much.  My eyes are trying to work out what you want me to notice -is it the boat?  Is it the refection in the water or is it the curve of the shore.  One of those in clearer focus would have been easier on the eye.', '2007-10-26 17:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197896, 603602, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little heavy in the shadows, otherwise pretty good.</td>', 'A little heavy in the shadows, otherwise pretty good.', '2007-10-26 17:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197899, 604099, 83313, '<td valign="top">Low contrast, though that is probably by design.</td>', 'Low contrast, though that is probably by design.', '2007-10-26 17:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197900, 603788, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great subject and I like the viewpoint you''ve offered.  This image is VERY dark though - which although makes it moody and interesting, also means details are lost - I''d have tried to lighten it with shadows/highlights (if you use photoshop), or perhaps Contrast/Brightness.</td>', 'Great subject and I like the viewpoint you''ve offered.  This image is VERY dark though - which although makes it moody and interesting, also means details are lost - I''d have tried to lighten it with shadows/highlights (if you use photoshop), or perhaps Contrast/Brightness.', '2007-10-26 17:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197904, 603864, 64670, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this is a very beautiful place, but I can''t really get a good sense of it due to the time of day this image was taken.  It''s nice and clear, but I needs for highlights.</td>', 'I''m sure this is a very beautiful place, but I can''t really get a good sense of it due to the time of day this image was taken.  It''s nice and clear, but I needs for highlights.', '2007-10-26 17:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197906, 603041, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not any "wow" factor in this one, but an excellent conveyance of the idea.</td>', 'Not any "wow" factor in this one, but an excellent conveyance of the idea.', '2007-10-26 17:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197907, 603670, 64670, '<td valign="top">Very cool take on ''distance'' and I really like the icy blue shades.  I''m taking a guess at saying it''s been taken ''hand held''.  I think a tripod may have assisted with clarity.  Also due to the incredibly flat sky I''d have cropped quite a bit of it out.</td>', 'Very cool take on ''distance'' and I really like the icy blue shades.  I''m taking a guess at saying it''s been taken ''hand held''.  I think a tripod may have assisted with clarity.  Also due to the incredibly flat sky I''d have cropped quite a bit of it out.', '2007-10-26 17:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197910, 604111, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but the lighiting makes it bland. Flourescent lights are not the best for interesting photos.</td>', 'A good idea, but the lighiting makes it bland. Flourescent lights are not the best for interesting photos.', '2007-10-26 17:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197911, 603944, 79562, '<td valign="top">sorry, I think the boat crop is distracting</td>', 'sorry, I think the boat crop is distracting', '2007-10-26 17:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197913, 603902, 64670, '<td valign="top">Nice adstract.  The colours are nice.<br/> <br/>I have no idea what the image is, or what you are trying to portray.  I think the addition of the words ''Troll Trap'' takes away from your image.  It''s like you''re baiting in a ''reverse psychology'' way in the hope you get a higher vote.   In my opinion each image just needs to ''speak'' for itself without ''teasers'' in the title to ''work'' for it.</td>', 'Nice adstract.  The colours are nice. I have no idea what the image is, or what you are trying to portray.  I think the addition of the words ''Troll Trap'' takes away from your image.  It''s like you''re baiting in a ''reverse psychology'' way in the hope you get a higher vote.   In my opinion each image just needs to ''speak'' for itself without ''teasers'' in the title to ''work'' for it.', '2007-10-26 17:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197921, 602072, 64670, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice location.  <br/> <br/>I''m thinking you want my eyes to be drawn to the image at the top of the stairs.  Unfortunately due to the flatness of the image up there, it doesn''t automatically happen.  The stairs in the higher up group seem to have the greater focus which doesn''t sit well with the viewer.</td>', 'Looks like a nice location.   I''m thinking you want my eyes to be drawn to the image at the top of the stairs.  Unfortunately due to the flatness of the image up there, it doesn''t automatically happen.  The stairs in the higher up group seem to have the greater focus which doesn''t sit well with the viewer.', '2007-10-26 17:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197924, 602742, 64670, '<td valign="top">Quirky image - very cute.  The negative space to the right is a bit unsettling, perhaps a bit more or less would have worked well.  Good depth of field.</td>', 'Quirky image - very cute.  The negative space to the right is a bit unsettling, perhaps a bit more or less would have worked well.  Good depth of field.', '2007-10-26 17:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197932, 602472, 64670, '<td valign="top">This image in no way suggests ''distance'' to me.  It would work for a ''movement'' challenge, or ''blur'', but not distance.<br/> <br/>In addition the vehicles behind are a distraction and in no way enhance the image.  <br/> <br/>My suggestion would be to crop the bottom third horizontally, then work with Constrast or Selective Colours, to bring out some depth and then maybe add a slight black frame.</td>', 'This image in no way suggests ''distance'' to me.  It would work for a ''movement'' challenge, or ''blur'', but not distance. In addition the vehicles behind are a distraction and in no way enhance the image.   My suggestion would be to crop the bottom third horizontally, then work with Constrast or Selective Colours, to bring out some depth and then maybe add a slight black frame.', '2007-10-26 17:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197939, 602739, 64670, '<td valign="top">WOW - that''s some light blob!  I think it''s ''too much''.  I can get what you''re trying to convey but the white has just blown out ''too much''.  Might also want to consider cropping the forground out quite aggressively.  I don''t think it serves any assistance to the image.</td>', 'WOW - that''s some light blob!  I think it''s ''too much''.  I can get what you''re trying to convey but the white has just blown out ''too much''.  Might also want to consider cropping the forground out quite aggressively.  I don''t think it serves any assistance to the image.', '2007-10-26 17:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197942, 603464, 64670, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  I''m thinking this image was not shot using a tripod.  It suffered clarity by being ''hand held''.<br/> <br/>I like the position of the sign.  <br/> <br/>The foliage lack Shadows and Highlights.</td>', 'Cute idea.  I''m thinking this image was not shot using a tripod.  It suffered clarity by being ''hand held''. I like the position of the sign.   The foliage lack Shadows and Highlights.', '2007-10-26 17:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197947, 603868, 64670, '<td valign="top">Quirky choice.<br/> <br/>I like the grungy look and the citrusy hues.</td>', 'Quirky choice. I like the grungy look and the citrusy hues.', '2007-10-26 17:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197950, 603941, 64670, '<td valign="top">I''m sure it''s a lovely location and it probably looked spectacular in your eyes, I don''t think the camera has done it justice.<br/> <br/>The excessive messy sand in the foreground is distracting.<br/> <br/>There appears to be some driftwood towards the shore,  I think I''d have explored the option of getting closer to that and using it as a diagonal ''anchor'' to the sunburst clouds.</td>', 'I''m sure it''s a lovely location and it probably looked spectacular in your eyes, I don''t think the camera has done it justice. The excessive messy sand in the foreground is distracting. There appears to be some driftwood towards the shore,  I think I''d have explored the option of getting closer to that and using it as a diagonal ''anchor'' to the sunburst clouds.', '2007-10-26 17:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197956, 603085, 64670, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  <br/> <br/>I''m not a great fan of the ''put my camera on an angle to add interest'' choice.<br/> <br/>I mostly like to let the image ''BE'' the interest.  Especially in this case when it appears you have interesting doors to ''frame'' 1/3 of the way into the image.</td>', 'Cute idea.   I''m not a great fan of the ''put my camera on an angle to add interest'' choice. I mostly like to let the image ''BE'' the interest.  Especially in this case when it appears you have interesting doors to ''frame'' 1/3 of the way into the image.', '2007-10-26 17:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197959, 603371, 64670, '<td valign="top">This image is not convincing to me.  <br/> <br/>To add conviction a more ''edgy'' viewpoint would have been appreciated.  In addition the bright colours of the very ''clean'' jeans really detracts from the idea that this person is infact displaced.<br/> <br/>A grungy B&amp;W may have helped.</td>', 'This image is not convincing to me.   To add conviction a more ''edgy'' viewpoint would have been appreciated.  In addition the bright colours of the very ''clean'' jeans really detracts from the idea that this person is infact displaced. A grungy B&W may have helped.', '2007-10-26 17:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197962, 603315, 64670, '<td valign="top">Very quirky image.  The juxtaposition between a ''funky'' disco ball and seemingly ''elderly'' people and bicycle in the rear is slightly odd - but not unpleasantly so.</td>', 'Very quirky image.  The juxtaposition between a ''funky'' disco ball and seemingly ''elderly'' people and bicycle in the rear is slightly odd - but not unpleasantly so.', '2007-10-26 17:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
