(4198073, 604006, 23251, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! That''s what I wanted to shoot but settled for a shot that I shoehorned in.  Excellent photo, great DOF and meets the challenge spot on, well done! scoring high.</td>', 'Fantastic! That''s what I wanted to shoot but settled for a shot that I shoehorned in.  Excellent photo, great DOF and meets the challenge spot on, well done! scoring high.', '2007-10-26 18:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
