(4200992, 602745, 5746, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Maybe a little different angle could be better. A bit to the right to make the phone on the right less dominant. I like the choice of B&amp;W. 8.</td>', 'Great concept. Maybe a little different angle could be better. A bit to the right to make the phone on the right less dominant. I like the choice of B&W. 8.', '2007-10-28 05:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
