(4201244, 603004, 70151, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot, but I think it would have looked even cooler if you did a vertical composition and you lowered yourself against the twig so that all you could basically see was the caterpillar and the stick going up to a vanishing point. Distance would be more pronounced, because all of the other stuff out of focus is slightly distracting right now. :)</td>', 'This is a cool shot, but I think it would have looked even cooler if you did a vertical composition and you lowered yourself against the twig so that all you could basically see was the caterpillar and the stick going up to a vanishing point. Distance would be more pronounced, because all of the other stuff out of focus is slightly distracting right now. :)', '2007-10-28 11:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
