(4207059, 603181, 83313, '<td valign="top">Almost made the brown ribbon with this one. The score was not unexpected. I had an idea, but was not able to get it across visually.<br/> <br/>The graininess was intentionally induced. An artistic effort that was probably not obvious enough, so just looked flawed. The blur of the screwdriver was not intentional at the time of the shot, but I felt it looked like someone struggling to reach the screw.<br/> <br/>Here''s the (resized) out of the camera shot. If anyone can suggest how to make it better, I am interested in the feedback:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=606845" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/606845.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/606845.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/606845.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-31 00:21:58.</i></td>', 'Almost made the brown ribbon with this one. The score was not unexpected. I had an idea, but was not able to get it across visually. The graininess was intentionally induced. An artistic effort that was probably not obvious enough, so just looked flawed. The blur of the screwdriver was not intentional at the time of the shot, but I felt it looked like someone struggling to reach the screw. Here''s the (resized) out of the camera shot. If anyone can suggest how to make it better, I am interested in the feedback:', '2007-10-31 00:19:21.000000', '2007-10-31 00:21:58.000000', 0),
