(4207127, 603566, 69325, '<td valign="top">you say:"DPC is such a friggin cliche maker. Take a good, simple photograph that has no meaning and it will do well.<br/> <br/>If this does well (I doubt it will, I''m just saying it''s a worse version of everything else on here), I have no respect for DPC."<br/> <br/>So why enter? Just to prove your artistic snobbery? How cliche we all are?<br/>Why bother? Obviously this is a waste of your very high minded time!<br/> <br/>I had to edit this post because i see you are 16. So to a degree I can cut you some slack, you think you know and can conquer everything at 16, which is not a bad thing, but you have some growing up to do.<br/>And for the record...I love the shot!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-31 00:39:20.</i></td>', 'you say:"DPC is such a friggin cliche maker. Take a good, simple photograph that has no meaning and it will do well. If this does well (I doubt it will, I''m just saying it''s a worse version of everything else on here), I have no respect for DPC." So why enter? Just to prove your artistic snobbery? How cliche we all are?Why bother? Obviously this is a waste of your very high minded time! I had to edit this post because i see you are 16. So to a degree I can cut you some slack, you think you know and can conquer everything at 16, which is not a bad thing, but you have some growing up to do.And for the record...I love the shot!', '2007-10-31 00:31:36.000000', '2007-10-31 00:39:20.000000', 0),
