(4207649, 603333, 80908, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by saraaahh:</b></div><hr/><i> This shot is amazing, considering it was taken from a plane. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The trick to have the door open... :o)<br/> <br/>Thanks to those who commented - it is always a little trickier to frame stuff when you can''t use the viewfinder... or the manual shutter release... and have to set your camera before you helmet mount it ready to jump...<br/> <br/>But I like this photo - shame on those who only reckoned it was worth 2 or 3 points... ;o)</td>', 'Originally posted by saraaahh: This shot is amazing, considering it was taken from a plane.   The trick to have the door open... :o) Thanks to those who commented - it is always a little trickier to frame stuff when you can''t use the viewfinder... or the manual shutter release... and have to set your camera before you helmet mount it ready to jump... But I like this photo - shame on those who only reckoned it was worth 2 or 3 points... ;o)', '2007-10-31 06:08:49.000000', NULL, 0),
