(4208232, 604084, 62671, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by colorcarnival:</b></div><hr/><i> LOL i LIKE the car on the road because it really helps cement the idea of DISTANCE.  Have you ever gone flying up that hill so you can experience a great drop on the other side?  My kids love that kind of stuff.  Good find! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Funny you say that,  My husband tried it with the hill behind us!  LOL<br/>but this one you see is a small one around here.  we have LOTS of big hills.</td>', 'Originally posted by colorcarnival: LOL i LIKE the car on the road because it really helps cement the idea of DISTANCE.  Have you ever gone flying up that hill so you can experience a great drop on the other side?  My kids love that kind of stuff.  Good find!   Funny you say that,  My husband tried it with the hill behind us!  LOLbut this one you see is a small one around here.  we have LOTS of big hills.', '2007-10-31 10:35:50.000000', NULL, 0),
