(4208571, 603828, 68586, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge - but I really like how understated this<br/>is. The B&amp;W is perfect for it and I really like the fact that the texture shows through on both the tape and the back cloth. The positioning of the needle anchors the whole picture.<br/> <br/>great shot, and possibly a very good ''stock shot''</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge - but I really like how understated thisis. The B&W is perfect for it and I really like the fact that the texture shows through on both the tape and the back cloth. The positioning of the needle anchors the whole picture. great shot, and possibly a very good ''stock shot''', '2007-10-31 12:55:23.000000', NULL, 0),
