(4208960, 603181, 5746, '<td valign="top">I gave it 7. I read it exactly like you intended. The blur is a bit distracting, but I saw the point in it. I like B&amp;W and the crop itself. I like the roughness of the picture. I don''t think picture has to be razor sharp to be good. To me it is a good picture which conveys the challenge theme in a clever and unusual way. <br/> <br/>But, what do I know...</td>', 'I gave it 7. I read it exactly like you intended. The blur is a bit distracting, but I saw the point in it. I like B&W and the crop itself. I like the roughness of the picture. I don''t think picture has to be razor sharp to be good. To me it is a good picture which conveys the challenge theme in a clever and unusual way.  But, what do I know...', '2007-10-31 16:21:34.000000', NULL, 0),
