(4210220, 602270, 67697, '<td valign="top">The noise does not really bother me, because that adds to the disturbance of the storm.  But the trees catch my eye more than anything else.  That to me was a better conveyance of distance.</td>', 'The noise does not really bother me, because that adds to the disturbance of the storm.  But the trees catch my eye more than anything else.  That to me was a better conveyance of distance.', '2007-10-31 23:50:44.000000', NULL, 0),
