(4212504, 602312, 24168, '<td valign="top">I''ve added this picture to my favorites, and I like the title even more than the image. Please never show me the original :) <br/> <br/>Something came to me when I saw this picture, and I noted it down. <br/> <br/><i>Over the mountains, <br/>across the foothills, <br/>into the plains beyond ..<br/> <br/>Flying uncertain,<br/>composing idylls, <br/>towards a morning born .. <br/> <br/>Orange skies, <br/>blue shadows, <br/>and a golden sun .. <br/> <br/>A painter''s eyes, <br/>few cupid''s arrows, <br/>and a yellow ribbon ? </i> <br/> <br/>I''ve also [url=//poojac20.blogspot.com/2007/11/yellow-ribbon.html ]posted[/url] this on my blog. Hope nobody minds.</td>', 'I''ve added this picture to my favorites, and I like the title even more than the image. Please never show me the original :)  Something came to me when I saw this picture, and I noted it down.  Over the mountains, across the foothills, into the plains beyond .. Flying uncertain,composing idylls, towards a morning born ..  Orange skies, blue shadows, and a golden sun ..  A painter''s eyes, few cupid''s arrows, and a yellow ribbon ?   I''ve also [url=//poojac20.blogspot.com/2007/11/yellow-ribbon.html ]posted[/url] this on my blog. Hope nobody minds.', '2007-11-01 14:20:03.000000', NULL, 0),
