(4212922, 603104, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by travis_cooper:</b></div><hr/><i> This shot looks very 2d to me, yes I realize it is a picture, but the lighting and the sky make everything look very flat.  There isn''t really any detail to the picture, it almost looks like a drawing. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I think that''s what I like about it -- it reminds me of one I considered entering myself, though I ended up in the other challenge. I like the soothing blue shades ...</td>', 'Originally posted by travis_cooper: This shot looks very 2d to me, yes I realize it is a picture, but the lighting and the sky make everything look very flat.  There isn''t really any detail to the picture, it almost looks like a drawing.  I think that''s what I like about it -- it reminds me of one I considered entering myself, though I ended up in the other challenge. I like the soothing blue shades ...', '2007-11-01 16:57:19.000000', NULL, 0),
