(4216217, 604006, 68035, '<td valign="top">Ron...Blimey another 6+, another front page and yet another weird creature<br/> <br/>I have to say I loved some of the alternate views of distance in the challenge and this was one of those because it encapsulated both a very short distance and at the same time (for the ant) quite a considerable one<br/> <br/>The bokeh on this really gave the shot a boost in terms of pop<br/> <br/>Nice job</td>', 'Ron...Blimey another 6+, another front page and yet another weird creature I have to say I loved some of the alternate views of distance in the challenge and this was one of those because it encapsulated both a very short distance and at the same time (for the ant) quite a considerable one The bokeh on this really gave the shot a boost in terms of pop Nice job', '2007-11-02 15:59:35.000000', NULL, 0),
