(4233098, 603104, 68504, '<td valign="top">The subtlety in this apparently simple picture, like unto a Japanese print, is that it is NOT flat at all. To paraphrase <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a>from somewhere else, you have to took and look and not quite see.</td>', 'The subtlety in this apparently simple picture, like unto a Japanese print, is that it is NOT flat at all. To paraphrase  posthumousfrom somewhere else, you have to took and look and not quite see.', '2007-11-08 17:47:02.000000', NULL, 0),
