(5591280, 603863, 48560, '<td valign="top">nice photos, <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=923264" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">you must have a very expensive camera</a> ;)<br/> <br/>but really, just read your own comments on this photo,<br/>"My first try, and ribbon. Canon EF 50mm f/1.8 II a very good lens to take pictures."<br/>why would you have said that?<br/> <br/>frankly, i wouldn''t be able to pull that kind of DOF with my cheap gear.<br/>stand too near and i wont get her entirely in the photo, stand too far and i lost the shallow DOF.<br/> <br/>so... hope i made my point ;) no offense, k?</td>', 'nice photos, you must have a very expensive camera ;) but really, just read your own comments on this photo,"My first try, and ribbon. Canon EF 50mm f/1.8 II a very good lens to take pictures."why would you have said that? frankly, i wouldn''t be able to pull that kind of DOF with my cheap gear.stand too near and i wont get her entirely in the photo, stand too far and i lost the shallow DOF. so... hope i made my point ;) no offense, k?', '2009-07-30 05:17:44.000000', NULL, 0),
